OL,3,GNEWSA'Inhumane' conditions at migrant
OL,4,Acentre, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report says a Sussex immigration
OL,7,Fremoval centre is a "relatively
OL,8,Fvolatile" environment where men feel
OL,9,Funsafe.
OL,11,FRepresentatives of the Gatwick
OL,12,FImmigration Removal Centre independent
OL,13,Fmonitoring board (IMB) said that,
OL,14,Fdespite improvements, some people at
OL,15,FBrook House and Tinsley House were
OL,16,Fhaving their dignity and rights
OL,17,Fundermined, including being locked up
OL,18,Ffor 12 hours a day.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
