OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Inhumane' conditions at migrant
OL,4,Acentre, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report, released today, also found
OL,7,Fa "disturbingly high" number of
OL,8,Fchildren are being detained at the
OL,9,Fcentre, which was subject to a public
OL,10,Finquiry in 2017.
OL,12,FA Home Office spokesperson said it
OL,13,Fwelcomed the IMB's feedback, and is
OL,14,Fsetting up an independent immigration
OL,15,Fappeals authority which it says will
OL,16,Fspeed up claims.
